      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "新宇宙陷入沉默，\r\n只是无言地注视着巨浪之后的远方——\r\n那平静的海平线。",
      "source_fingerprint": "fccee953051da6c8efe6ce55d449235d9401d878b13aab66bbbe960e33b116ec",
